<p>Someone has requested password reset for your account on <a href="{{ domain }}">{{ site_name }}</a>.</p>
<p>If it was you, click 👉 <a href="{{ domain }}/uc/password/{{ user_id }}/{{ token }}">here</a> 👈 and set up new password.</p>
<p>If it was <b>not</b> you, we recommend logging in to the website to let the token get reset. If you have fresh cookies for the website, just opening the website will be enough. You can also check recent security log in your profile <a href="{{ domain }}/uc/sessions">here</a>.</p>
